{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00717","headline":"郊庙歌辞 昭德皇后庙乐章 凯安 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 昭德皇后庙乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辰位列四星，帝功参十乱。\n进贤勤内辅，扈跸清多难。\n承天厚载均，并耀宵光璨。\n留徽蔼前躅，万古披图焕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}